  "prefLabel": "Mid 406.04 Public Professional Presentations Relating to Midwifery",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-11-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 406.04 Public Professional Presentations Relating to Midwifery. Documentation of public professional presentations relating to midwifery shall include:\n\n(a) A copy of the official program of the presentation; or\n\n(b) Written verification signed by a representative of the program's sponsor showing:\n\n(1) The title of the presentation;\n\n(2) The name of the midwife as presenter;\n\n(3) The date of the presentation;\n\n(4) The hours during which the presentation took place; and\n\n(5) The type of audience attending the presentation.\n\nSource. #8840, eff 3-13-07, EXPIRED: 3-13-15\n\nNew. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16\n\nNew. #12040, eff 11-10-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid400.html"
